HST Office: more of VBA from real files: errors by number, .xlam, Debug.Print lists, Dictionary typed variables.

- d(key) = value on Dim d As Dictionary failed with "object not set": the assignment went to the variable. 3.5% of files use As New Dictionary.
- Worksheets("none"): "Subscript out of range", error 9, not error 1, so code that tests Err.Number works.
- Debug.Print a; b runs through a function, as an expression statement failed at run time with a list.
- A Type member called Name or Parent replaces the property every object has.
- Public Event is read in any module position.
- .xlam add-ins open.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/vba-corpus/language_cases.py, regression_cases.py.
